      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Arthur\u2019s Log\n\nThe assumption that time is linear collapsed once
    again today.\nMy observations show that the order between cause and effect can
    change.\nIf you are reading this note before I wrote it, then the experiment
    has successfully crossed the boundary.\n\nDo not reset the core when shutting
    down the system.\n\nSome consequences have not yet occurred."
